{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懺悔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名淨業痛策"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心永空靜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作已便止，不必拜，要盡此生，不得一日暫廢，唯將不廢，自要其\n心，得生淨土。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出淨土十要"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "接發願云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "加於\n\n彌陀經禮想儀極樂世界大慈大悲阿彌陀佛下，先讀此文，然後念佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因每每出聲念佛，胸頭微痛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈雲大師云：「勸得一人生淨土，縱自不修\n行，亦合得生佛國。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先明因果，方肯念佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附淨業痛䇿之後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
